### 测试无限级评论功能

### 1. 添加主评论
POST http://localhost:8101/api/comment/add
Content-Type: application/json
userId: 1

{
  "patternId": 1,
  "content": "这是一条主评论，测试无限级评论功能"
}

### 2. 添加二级回复（回复主评论）
POST http://localhost:8101/api/comment/add
Content-Type: application/json
userId: 2

{
  "patternId": 1,
  "parentId": 1001,  # 替换为上面返回的主评论ID
  "content": "这是二级回复，回复主评论"
}

### 3. 添加三级回复（回复二级回复）
POST http://localhost:8101/api/comment/add
Content-Type: application/json
userId: 3

{
  "patternId": 1,
  "parentId": 1002,  # 替换为上面返回的二级回复ID
  "content": "这是三级回复，回复二级回复"
}

### 4. 添加四级回复（回复三级回复）
POST http://localhost:8101/api/comment/add
Content-Type: application/json
userId: 1

{
  "patternId": 1,
  "parentId": 1003,  # 替换为上面返回的三级回复ID
  "content": "这是四级回复，回复三级回复"
}

### 5. 添加五级回复（回复四级回复）
POST http://localhost:8101/api/comment/add
Content-Type: application/json
userId: 2

{
  "patternId": 1,
  "parentId": 1004,  # 替换为上面返回的四级回复ID
  "content": "这是五级回复，继续深入讨论"
}

### 6. 查询评论列表（验证无限级评论）
GET http://localhost:8101/api/comment/list/1?pageNum=1&pageSize=10
userId: 1

### 7. 查询评论统计
GET http://localhost:8101/api/comment/statistics/1

### 8. 验证数据库中的 rootId 和 replyToUserId
# 在 MySQL 中执行以下查询
/*
SELECT 
    id,
    parentId,
    rootId,
    replyToUserId,
    content,
    CASE 
        WHEN parentId IS NULL THEN '主评论'
        WHEN rootId IS NULL THEN '未设置rootId的回复'
        ELSE CONCAT('回复（rootId=', rootId, ', replyToUserId=', replyToUserId, '）')
    END as commentType
FROM comment
WHERE patternId = 1 AND isDelete = 0
ORDER BY COALESCE(rootId, id), createTime;
*/

### 9. 点赞评论
POST http://localhost:8101/api/comment/like?commentId=1001
userId: 2

### 10. 删除评论（验证回复数减少）
DELETE http://localhost:8101/api/comment/delete?commentId=1005
userId: 2

### 预期结果验证

# 1. 主评论
# - id: 1001
# - parentId: null
# - rootId: null
# - replyToUserId: null
# - replyCount: 4 (所有子回复数)

# 2. 二级回复
# - id: 1002
# - parentId: 1001
# - rootId: 1001
# - replyToUserId: 用户1的ID
# - 显示: @用户1 这是二级回复，回复主评论

# 3. 三级回复
# - id: 1003
# - parentId: 1002
# - rootId: 1001
# - replyToUserId: 用户2的ID
# - 显示: @用户2 这是三级回复，回复二级回复

# 4. 四级回复
# - id: 1004
# - parentId: 1003
# - rootId: 1001
# - replyToUserId: 用户3的ID
# - 显示: @用户3 这是四级回复，回复三级回复

# 5. 五级回复
# - id: 1005
# - parentId: 1004
# - rootId: 1001
# - replyToUserId: 用户1的ID
# - 显示: @用户1 这是五级回复，继续深入讨论

